==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 1

==Battleground==
*1 [[Sir Seal]] spawns as the boss after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>.
*1 [[Gory]] spawns as the boss after 3.33 seconds<sup>100f</sup>.
*1 [[Baa Baa]] spawns as the boss.
*1 [[Assassin Bear]] spawns after 900 seconds<sup>27,000f</sup>.

==Strategy==
A very easy stage that any unit can beat. Bring any of the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to win.

